      },
      "message": "fix(dxf): reserve stock aliases and validate profile summaries\n\nReserve the stock source word in every ASCII case for explicit names and file stems. Validate stored summary counts and their total before constructing a sketch, and use the checked total in profile views. Pin both corrupt-project paths and preserve existing worlds on refusal.\n\nRefs #1862",
